| GitHub | Administrator access, existing repository owners, third-party applications, fork automation, webhook replay, and settings changes remain alternate authority. |
| OpenClaw | Sandbox-first upgrades help, but the upgrade’s authorization, signed origin, plug-ins, state conversion, rollback, and initial trust are unspecified. |
